MODULE: AbandonedRecoversWithoutHistoryEntitlement
TARGET: RecoveryEntitled
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: abandoned identity bypasses retained prepare cardinality and complete terminal membership
PERTURBS: CaptureHorizon, Recover

--- FIND
    /\ PrepareCardinalityKnown /\ CompleteTerminalSet
    /\ horizonWal = "none"
--- REPLACE
    /\ KnownTerminals # {}
    /\ horizonWal = "none"
--- END

--- FIND
    /\ HistoryEntitled /\ horizonWal = wal /\ AtHorizon
--- REPLACE
    /\ horizonWal = wal /\ AtHorizon
--- END
